{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.1", "text": "κοσμησας ως ηθελησεν. 'Αλλ' ημεϊς μεν πεπιστευκαμεν", "corrections": ["dehyphenation"]}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.2", "text": "τη αναστασει, δοξαν αναπεμποντες τω", "corrections": ["dehyphenation"]}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.3", "text": "Πατρι και τω Υιω και τω αγιω Πνευματι, νυν και"}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.4", "text": "δει, και εις τους αιωνας των αιωνων. 'Αμην."}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.5", "text": "Δ' ΑΟΓΟΣ Δ'."}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.6", "text": "Εις τον αγιον και σωτηριον Πασχα."}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.7", "text": "Η μεν αληθινη του Σαββατου καταπαυσις, η την"}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.8", "text": "ευλογιαν του Θεου δεξαμενη, εν η κατεπαυσεν απο"}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.9", "text": "των εαυτου εργων ο Κυριος υπερ της του κοσμου σωτηριας", "corrections": ["dehyphenation"]}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.10", "text": "τη απραξια του θανατου ενσαδασαας, ήδη", "corrections": ["dehyphenation"]}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.11", "text": "περας εχει, και την ιδιαν εδειξε χαριν και οφθαλμοις"}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.12", "text": "και ακοαις και καρδια δι παντων τούτων της εορτης"}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.13", "text": "ημιν τελεσθεισης, οις εδομεν, οις ηκουσαμεν, οις τη"}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.14", "text": "καρδια την ευφροσυνην υπεδεξαμεθα. Το μεν γαρ"}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.15", "text": "ορωμενον τοις οφθαλμοις, φως εν τη του πυρος νεφελη", "corrections": ["dehyphenation"]}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.16", "text": "δια των λαμπάδων ημιν εν τη νυκτι δαδουχουμενον.", "corrections": ["dehyphenation"]}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.17", "text": "Ο δε παννυχιος; ταις ακοαις προσηχων λογος", "corrections": ["dehyphenation"]}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.18", "text": "εν ψαλμοις και θυνοις και ωδαις πνευματικαις, ολον"}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.19", "text": "ρευμα χαρας δι' ακοης εις την ψυχην εισρεων, πληρεις", "corrections": ["dehyphenation"]}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.20", "text": "ημας των αγαθων ελπιδων εποισεν. Η δε καρδια", "corrections": ["dehyphenation"]}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.21", "text": "τοις λεγομενοις τε και βλεπομενοις ευφραινομενη,", "corrections": ["dehyphenation"]}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.22", "text": "την αφαυστον ετυπωτο μακαριτητα, δια των φαινομενων", "corrections": ["dehyphenation"]}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.23", "text": "χειραγωγουμενη προς το αορατον. 'Ωστε των", "corrections": ["dehyphenation"]}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.24", "text": "αγαθων εκείνων, α ουτε οφθαλμος ειδεν, ουτε ους"}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.25", "text": "ηκουσεν, ουτε επι καρδιαν ανθρωπου ανεβη, εικονα"}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.26", "text": "ειναι τα της καταπαυσεως ταυτης αγαθα, δι' εαυτων"}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.27", "text": "την ανεκφωνητον ελπιδα των αποκειμενων πιστου-"}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.28", "text": "μενα. 'Επειδη τοιυν φωτεινη νυξ αυτη, τας εκ των"}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.29", "text": "λαμπάδων αυγας ορθραις ακται του ηλιου συμμι-"}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.30", "text": "ξασα, μίαν κατά το συνεχες ημεραν εποισεν, μη δια-"}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.31", "text": "μερισθεισα τη παρενθει δια του σκότους, νοησωμεν,"}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.32", "text": "αδελφοι, την προφητειαν την λεγουσαν, δια Αυτη"}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.33", "text": "εστιν η ημέρα, ην εποισεν ο Κυριος. Εν η εργον"}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.34", "text": "εστιν, ου βαρυ τι και δυσκατορθωτον, αλλα χαρ και"}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.35", "text": "ευφροσυνη και αγαλλιαμα · ουτως επιπτοντος του λογου"}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.36", "text": "οτι 'Αγαλλιασωμεθα και ευφρανθωμεν εν αυτη."}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.37", "text": "Ω καλων πραγμάτων! ω γλυκειας νομοθεσιας! Τις"}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.38", "text": "υπερτιθεται προς το υποκουσαι τοιουτος προστα-"}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.39", "text": "γμας; τις δε ουχι ζημιαν ηγεται και την εν ολιγω"}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.40", "text": "των πραγμάτων αναβολην; Ευφροσυνη το εργον, και"}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.41", "text": "αγαλλιαμα εστι το επιταγμα · δι' ων αναλυεται η"}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.42", "text": "επι τη αμαρτια καταχρωσις, και εις χαραν τα λυπηρα"}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.43", "text": "μεθαμβοζεται."}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.44", "text": "Τουτο εστι το της σοφιας απορθηγμα, οτι εν ημέρα"}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.45", "text": "ευφροσυνης, αμνηστια κακων. Αληθη εποισεν της"}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.46", "text": "πρωτης καθ' ημων αποφασεως, η ημέρα αυτη · μαλλον", "corrections": ["dehyphenation"]}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.47", "text": "δε αφανισμον, ουχι ληθην. 'Εξηλειφε γαρ καθόλου", "corrections": ["dehyphenation"]}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.48", "text": "παν μνημόσυνον της καθ' ημων κατακρίσεως.", "corrections": ["dehyphenation"]}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.49", "text": "Τότε εν λυπαις ο τοκετος · νυν χωρίς ωδινων η γεννησις.", "corrections": ["dehyphenation"]}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.50", "text": "'Ιτε εκ σαρκος εγεννηθημεν αοχες · νυν το γεννηθεν", "corrections": ["dehyphenation"]}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.51", "text": "πνευμα εστιν εκ πνευματος. Τότε υιοι ανθρωπων", "corrections": ["dehyphenation"]}
{"urn": "gregorius-nyssenus.in-sanctum-et-salutare-pascha-vulgo-in-christi", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "edition": "migne-ocr-qwen36", "locus": "pg046_0348.52", "text": "· νυν τεκνα Θεου εγεννηθημεν. Τότε εις γην απ'", "corrections": ["dehyphenation"]}
